{"path":"header/csetjmp","title":"Standard library header <csetjmp>","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;csetjmp&gt;","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/csetjmp","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header was originally in the C standard library as <setjmp.h>.","html":"<p>This header was originally in the C standard library as <a href=\"/w/c/program\"><code>&lt;setjmp.h&gt;</code></a>.\n</p><p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program\">program support</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Types\">Types</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/jmp_buf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>jmp_buf</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  execution context type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Macros\">Macros</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/setjmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setjmp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  saves the context <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Functions\">Functions</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/longjmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>longjmp</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  jumps to specified location <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> jmp_buf <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see description */</span> <span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>noreturn<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> longjmp<span class=\"br0\">(</span>jmp_buf env, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> val<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#define setjmp(env) /* see description */</span></code></pre>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Synopsis","id":"Synopsis"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"header","title":"C++ Standard Library headers"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Standard library header <csetjmp>","children":[{"label":"Types","children":[{"label":"jmp_buf","note":"execution context type"}]},{"label":"Macros","children":[{"label":"setjmp","note":"saves the context"}]},{"label":"Functions","children":[{"label":"longjmp","note":"jumps to specified location"}]},{"label":"Synopsis"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":65,"codeBlockCount":1}
